hadiths[17]{hadithnumber,text}:
"221","Ali bin Abi Hashim ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nusayr bin Umar bin Yazid bin Qabisa bin Yazid Asadi ne mujh se bayan kiya, fulan se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: main ne Burma bin Layth bin Burma se suna, ke unhon ne Qabisa bin Burma Asadi se suna, unhon ne kaha: main Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas tha, to main ne Aap ko farmate hue suna: Duniya mein neki karne wale Akhirat mein neki karne wale hain, aur duniya mein burai karne wale Akhirat mein burai karne wale hain."
"222","Musa bin Ismail ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Hassan Anbari ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Hibban bin Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, aur Harmala un ki walida ke walid the, phir Safiyya bint Ulayba aur Duhayba bint Ulayba ne mujh se bayan kiya, aur un dono ke dada Harmala un ke walid ke walid the, ke unhon ne unhen khabar di, Harmala bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, ke woh nikle yahan tak ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaye, phir Aap ke paas rahe yahan tak ke Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne unhen pehchan liya, phir jab woh rawana hone lage to main ne apne dil mein kaha: Allah ki qasam main zaroor Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas aaunga taake ilm mein izafa hasil karun, phir main paidal chal kar aaya yahan tak ke Aap ke samne khara ho gaya, phir main ne kaha: aap mujhe kya hukm dete hain ke main amal karun, Aap ne farmaya: Ae Harmala, neki ikhtiyar kar aur burai se bach, phir main wapas gaya yahan tak ke sawari tak pahunch gaya, phir main mutawajjeh hua yahan tak ke apni jagah Aap ke qareeb khara ho gaya, phir main ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, aap mujhe kya hukm dete hain ke main amal karun, Aap ne farmaya: Ae Harmala, neki ikhtiyar kar aur burai se bach, aur dekh jo baat tere kaan ko achhi lage ke log tere liye kahen jab tu un ke paas se uthe to use ikhtiyar kar, aur dekh jis baat ko tu napasand kare ke log tere liye kahen jab tu un ke paas se uthe to us se bach, phir jab main wapas gaya to main ne ghor kiya to woh dono koi cheez nahin chhorte the."
"223","Hasan bin Umar ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mutamir ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: main ne apne walid se Hazrat Abu Usman ki Hazrat Salman se riwayat karda hadees ka zikr kiya, ke unhon ne kaha: Beshak duniya mein neki karne wale Akhirat mein neki karne wale hain, to unhon ne kaha: Beshak main ne use Hazrat Abu Usman se suna, woh use Hazrat Salman se bayan karte the, phir main ne jaan liya ke baat aisi hi hai, phir main ne use kabhi kisi se bayan nahin kiya."
"224","Ali bin Ayyash ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abu Ghassan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Muhammad bin Munkadir ne mujh se bayan kiya, Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah se riwayat hai, Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se ke Aap ne farmaya: Har neki sadqa hai."
"225","Adam bin Abi Iyas ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Saeed bin Abi Burda bin Abi Musa ne mujh se bayan kiya, apne walid se, apne dada se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Har Musalman par sadqa hai, unhon ne kaha: phir agar woh na paye, Aap ne farmaya: phir woh apne hathon se mehnat kare, phir apne aap ko faida pahunchaye aur sadqa kare, unhon ne kaha: phir agar woh istitaat na rakhe ya aisa na kare, Aap ne farmaya: phir woh hajatmand beqarar ki madad kare, unhon ne kaha: phir agar woh aisa na kare, Aap ne farmaya: phir woh bhalai ka hukm de ya neki ka hukm de, unhon ne kaha: phir agar woh aisa na kare, Aap ne farmaya: phir woh shar se ruka rahe, kyunke ye us ke liye sadqa hai."
"226","Musaddad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Yahya ne Hisham bin Urwa se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne mujh se bayan kiya, ke Abu Marawih Ghifari ne unhen khabar di, ke Hazrat Abu Zar ne unhen khabar di, ke unhon ne Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam se sawal kiya: kaun sa amal afzal hai, Aap ne farmaya: Allah par iman aur Us ke raste mein jihad, unhon ne kaha: phir kaun si gardan aazad karna afzal hai, Aap ne farmaya: jo qeemat mein sab se zyada ho aur apne walon ke nazdeek sab se nafees ho, unhon ne kaha: batayiye agar main aisa na karun, Aap ne farmaya: kisi be sahara ki madad kar ya na hunarmand ke liye kuch bana de, unhon ne kaha: batayiye agar main aisa na karun, Aap ne farmaya: logon ko shar se mehfooz rakh, kyunke ye sadqa hai jo tu apni taraf se sadqa karega."
"227","Abul Numan ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mahdi bin Maymun ne mujh se bayan kiya, Wasil mawla Abi Uyayna se, Yahya bin Aqeel se, Yahya bin Yamur se, Abul Aswad Dili se, Hazrat Abu Zar se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: kaha gaya: Ya Rasoolullah, maal wale ajr le gaye, namaz parhte hain jaise hum namaz parhte hain, aur roza rakhte hain jaise hum roza rakhte hain, aur apne maalon ki fazil miqdar se sadqa karte hain, unhon ne farmaya: kya Allah ne tumhare liye woh cheez nahin banai jis se tum sadqa karo, beshak har tasbeeh aur tahmeed mein sadqa hai, aur tum mein se kisi ka apni biwi se hambistari karna sadqa hai, kaha gaya: kya apni khwahish poori karne mein sadqa hai, unhon ne farmaya: agar use haram mein rakhta to kya us par gunah na hota, isi tarah agar use halal mein rakhe to us ke liye ajr hai."
"228","Abu Asim ne hum se bayan kiya, Aban bin Sama se, Abul Wazi Jabir se, Hazrat Abu Barza Aslami se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: main ne kaha: Ya Rasoolullah, mujhe aise amal ki rahnumai farmayen jo mujhe Jannat mein dakhil kare, Aap ne farmaya: logon ke raste se takleef deh cheez hata de."
"229","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Wuhayb ne Suhayl se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne Hazrat Abu Huraira raziyallahu anhu se, unhon ne Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam se bayan kiya, Aap ne farmaya: ek Musalman shakhs raste mein kante ke paas se guzra, phir us ne kaha: main zaroor is kante ko hataunga taake kisi Musalman shakhs ko takleef na de, phir us ki maghfirat kar di gayi."
"230","Musa ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mahdi ne Wasil se, Yahya bin Aqeel se, Yahya bin Yamur se, Abul Aswad Dili se, Hazrat Abu Zar se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: meri ummat ke aamal mere samne pesh kiye gaye, un ke achhe aur un ke bure, phir main ne un ke achhe aamalon mein paya ke takleef deh cheez raste se hatayi jati hai, aur main ne un ke bure aamalon mein paya: masjid mein thook jo dafan na kiya gaya ho."
"231","Bishr bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ne humen khabar di, unhon ne kaha: Abdul Jabbar bin Abbas Hamdani ne humen khabar di, Adi bin Thabit se, Abdullah bin Yazid Khatmi se riwayat hai, unhon ne kaha: Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: Har neki sadqa hai."
"232","Saeed bin Sulayman ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Mubarak ne Thabit se, Hazrat Anas se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ke paas jab koi cheez layi jati to Aap farmate: use falan aurat ki taraf le jao, kyunke woh Hazrat Khadija ki saheli thi, use falan ke ghar ki taraf le jao, kyunke woh Hazrat Khadija se muhabbat karti thi."
"233","Muhammad bin Kaseer ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Sufyan ne khabar di, Abu Malik Ashjai se, wo Ribi se, wo Huzaifa se, unhon ne farmaya: tumhare Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: har neki sadqa hai."
"234","Ishaq bin Makhlad ne hum se bayan kiya, wo Hammad bin Usama se, wo Misar se, unhon ne kaha: hamein Umar bin Qais ne bayan kiya, wo Amr bin Abi Qurrah al-Kindi se, unhon ne kaha: mere walid ne Salman ke samne apni behen ko pesh kiya to unhon ne inkar kar diya aur apni ek laundi se nikah kar liya jise Buqairah kaha jata tha, phir Abu Qurrah ko khabar pahunchi ke Huzaifa aur Salman ke darmiyan kuch muamla hua hai to wo unhen talash karte hue un ke pas aye to unhen bataya gaya ke wo apne sabzi wale khet me hain to wo un ki taraf chal pare to un se mulaqat hui is haal me ke un ke sath ek tokra tha jis me sabzi thi unhon ne apni lathi tokre ke kunde me dali hui thi aur wo un ke kandhe par tha to unhon ne kaha: ae Abu Abdullah tumhare aur Huzaifa ke darmiyan kya muamla hua tha, unhon ne kaha: Salman kehte hain: aur insan bada jald baaz hai, phir dono chal pare hatta ke Salman ke ghar aye phir Salman ghar me dakhil hue to kaha: assalamu alaikum phir Abu Qurrah ko ijazat di to wo dakhil hue to ek chadar darwaze par rakhi hui thi aur us ke sirhane kachi eenten thin aur ek ooni kambal tha to unhon ne kaha: apni khatoon ke bichhone par baitho jo wo apne liye bichhati hai, phir un se baat karne lage to kaha: Huzaifa aisi baten bayan karte the jo Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne gusse ki haalat me kuch logon ke bare me farmai thin to mere pas aya jata to mujh se un ke bare me poocha jata to me kehta: Huzaifa jo kehte hain use zyada jante hain aur me napasand karta hun ke logon ke darmiyan keenay hon, phir Huzaifa ke pas aya gaya to un se kaha gaya: Salman tumhari kahi hui baton me na tumhari tasdeeq karte hain na takzeeb karte hain, phir Huzaifa mere pas aye to kaha: ae Salman ibne Umm e Salman to maine kaha: ae Huzaifa ibne Umm e Huzaifa tum zaroor baaz ao ge ya me tumhare bare me Umar ko likhun ga, phir jab maine unhen Umar se daraya to unhon ne mujhe chhor diya, aur Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya tha: me Aulad e Adam me se hun pas meri ummat me se jo bhi banda ho jise maine lanat ki ho ya bura bhala kaha ho us ke mustahiq hue baghair to use us ke liye rehmat bana de."
"235","Ibn Abi Shaiba ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Yahya bin Isa ne bayan kiya, wo Amash se, wo Habib se, wo Saeed bin Jubair se, wo Ibn Abbas se, unhon ne kaha: Umar raziyallahu anhu ne farmaya: hamare sath apni qaum ki zameen ki taraf niklo, phir hum nikle to me aur Ubayy bin Kaab logon ke peeche the to ek badal utha to Ubayy ne kaha: ae Allah is ki takleef ko hum se hata de, phir hum un se ja mile aur un ke kajave bheeg chuke the to unhon ne kaha: jo tumhen pesh aya wo hamen kyun na pesh aya, maine kaha: unhon ne Allah azza wa jalla se dua ki ke is ki takleef ko hum se hata de to Umar ne kaha: kya tum ne hamare liye apne sath dua kyun na mangi."
"236","Muaz bin Fazala ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Hisham Dastuwai ne bayan kiya, wo Yahya bin Abi Kaseer se, wo Abu Salama se, unhon ne kaha: me Abu Saeed Khudri ke pas aya aur wo mere dost the to maine kaha: kya tum hamare sath khajoor ke baghat ki taraf na nikloge, to wo nikle aur un par un ki ek chadar thi."
"237","Muhammad bin Salam ne hum se bayan kiya, unhon ne kaha: hamein Muhammad bin Fuzail bin Ghazwan ne khabar di, wo Mugheera se, wo Umm e Musa se, unhon ne kaha: maine Ali salawatullahi alaihi ko kehte hue suna: Nabi sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne Abdullah bin Masood ko hukm diya ke darakht par charhen phir us se un ke liye kuch laen to un ke sathiyon ne Abdullah ki pindli ki taraf dekha to un ki pindliyon ke patle hone par hans pare to Rasoolullah sallallahu alaihi wasallam ne farmaya: tum kis bat par hanste ho, Abdullah ka paon meezan me Uhud se zyada bhari hai."
